PREAMBLE

This License establishes the conditions governing access to, use of, reproduction of, modification of, distribution of, and other forms of exploitation of software and original materials published by Ryoeh.

Its purpose is to protect the intellectual property rights of the author while permitting public inspection and study of publicly accessible materials.

The fundamental principle of this License is that public availability does not, by itself, constitute authorization for unrestricted use or exploitation.

This License shall be interpreted in accordance with applicable intellectual property laws, mandatory statutory exceptions, and the terms of the hosting platforms through which the Protected Materials are distributed.


